{"id":"chatcmpl-6f006cfb7f4c4c189bd01466532c2aa8","object":"chat.completion","created":1790609329,"model":"accounts/fireworks/models/glm-5p3-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n\"schema\": \"statement_candidate_v1\",\n\"request_id\": \"pilot-aero-summary-neighbour-v1\",\n\"results\": [\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"Assets\",\n\"outcome\": \"found\",\n\"value\": \"7193091\",\n\"scale\": \"1000\",\n\"source_label\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position (audited, Item 18, page F-6)\",\n\"unit\": \"USD\",\n\"currency\": \"USD\",\n\"period\": {\n\"kind\": \"instant\",\n\"start\": null,\n\"end\": \"2025-12-31\"\n},\n\"accounting_basis\": \"IFRS\",\n\"consolidation_scope\": \"consolidated\",\n\"location\": {\n\"accession\": \"0001193125-26-197494\",\n\"document\": \"d101275d20f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"b842756f7ce62b0ae1bd2cf14d6fc3373c61297c0a74934f020493332415326e\",\n\"table\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position\",\n\"row\": \"Total assets\",\n\"column\": \"2025\",\n\"html_anchor\": \"fin101275_2\",\n\"page\": null\n},\n\"evidence_quote\": \"Total assets — $ 7,193,091 (2025 column; statement headed \\\"As of December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023 (In thousands of US dollars)\\\", XBRL tag ifrs-full:Assets, ctx PAsOn12_31_2025)\"\n}\n]\n}","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to extract the \"Assets\" field from the consolidated primary balance sheet (statement of financial position) as of December 31, 2025.\n\nLooking at the document, I can find the Consolidated statements of financial position (the primary balance sheet in the audited financial statements section). In table T:A:638, there's a row for \"Total assets\" with the value tagged as `n=ifrs-full:Assets;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3` showing $7,193,091 (in thousands of US dollars).\n\nThe statement says \"(In thousands of US dollars)\" - so the scale is 1000 (thousands).\n\nThe value is 7,193,091 (in thousands of USD) = $7,193,091,000.\n\nLet