2\" points to the balance sheet. So html_anchor \"fin101275_2\" is right.\n\nFinal answer JSON.","tools":null},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":505863,"total_tokens":508697,"completion_tokens":2834,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2484},"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2484}}}